# [FABLE-5] sq-hmd7l.10 — vendored ORE-style task OUTSIDE the ALCH fragment
# (expected: UNKNOWN / out-of-fragment abstention).
# Hand-authored. A minCardinality restriction — routine in the real ORE 2014/2015
# corpora, outside sparq-reason-dl's scoped ALCH fragment. Pins the FAIL-CLOSED honesty
# behaviour the harness depends on: the checker must ABSTAIN
# (Verdict::Unknown(OutOfFragment)) rather than reason over a graph it only partially
# understood, and the harness must never enter such a row into a timing comparison.
@prefix : <http://sparq.dev/bench/ore-smoke/cardinality#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Person rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :hasParent ;
                          owl:minCardinality "2"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ] .
:x a :Person .
